  m_text: "<color=#FFD866><b>\uB450 \uBC29\uBC95 \uCF54\uB4DC \uBE44\uAD50</b></color>\n<color=#9BE89B>\uCF54\uB8E8\uD2F4</color>\n<noparse>IEnumerator OpenLater() {\n  yield return new WaitForSeconds(3f);\n  OpenDoor();\n}\nStartCoroutine(OpenLater());   // StopCoroutine \uC73C\uB85C \uCDE8\uC18C</noparse>\n\n<color=#FFB070>async / await</color> (Unity 6 Awaitable)\n<noparse>async Awaitable OpenLater(CancellationToken t) {\n  await Awaitable.WaitForSecondsAsync(3f, t);\n  OpenDoor();\n}\n_ = OpenLater(destroyCancellationToken);</noparse>\n\n\xB7 \uCF54\uB8E8\uD2F4: MonoBehaviour \uD544\uC694, \uC624\uBE0C\uC81D\uD2B8\uAC00 \uAEBC\uC9C0\uBA74 \uC790\uB3D9 \uC911\uB2E8\n\xB7 async: \uBC18\uD658\uAC12\xB7try/catch \uAC00 \uC790\uC5F0\uC2A4\uB7EC\uC6C0, \uCDE8\uC18C\uB294 \uD1A0\uD070\uC73C\uB85C\n\xB7 Task.Delay \uB294 Time.timeScale\xB7\uC77C\uC2DC\uC815\uC9C0\uB97C \uBB34\uC2DC \u2192 Awaitable \uAD8C\uC7A5"
